"description":"Quality medical care from anywhere. \n\n\nBoard-certified doctors and licensed clinicians are standing by to help you feel better, faster. \n\n\nAmwell provides access to 24/7 urgent care and scheduled appointments for therapy, psychiatry, nutrition counseling, pediatric care, women's health and more.\n\n\n - No appointment needed for urgent care\n - Prescriptions available*\n - Your health insurance may cover your visit\n - Secure and confidential care\n\n\nWe are here when you need us.\n\n\n24/7 URGENT CARE\nNo appointment necessary - visits often start in 10 minutes or less. Speak with a clinician for help with a range of common conditions, including coughs, colds, flu, UTIs in adult women, rashes and allergies, pinkeye, burns, cuts, and scrapes. Start a virtual visit now!\n\n\nTHERAPY\nLicensed therapists provide talk therapy to help with anxiety, depression, stress, relationship challenges, adolescent therapy, panic attacks, and other common issues. Choose your preferred therapist and schedule a virtual visit at a time that is convenient for you.  \nFor adults and children over the age of 10. Therapists do not prescribe medication.\n\n\nPSYCHIATRY\nBoard-certified and licensed psychiatrists help people who may need treatment with medication, who are already taking medication*, or who have a diagnosed mental disorder. Choose your psychiatrist and schedule a visit at a time that is convenient for you. \nFor patients over the age of 18.\n\n\nOTHER SERVICES AVAILABLE ON AMWELL\n - Women's health needs with experienced clinicians.\n - Breastfeeding support with International Board-Certified Lactation Consultants (IBCLCs).\n - Nutrition counseling with registered dieticians.\n - Pediatric urgent care with licensed pediatricians.\n - Second opinions from Cleveland Clinic expert physicians.\n\n\nABOUT THE AMWELL MEDICAL GROUP CLINICIANS\nAmwell partners with Amwell Medical Group, a primary care practice with a national network of board-certified doctors and licensed qualified clinicians who, on average, have 15 years of experience. Clinicians are both single- and multi-state licensed and credentialed to work in your state of residence; 24 hours a day, 365 days a year. Each of our clinicians goes through a rigorous selection process to become a part of the network.\n\n\nOur years of clinical and virtual care experience help us to provide the highest quality care to patients of all backgrounds. \n\n\n*Prescription medication is based on provider judgement. Controlled substances are not prescribed, refilled, or managed through these services.\n\n\nAll clinical care rendered on the Amwell platform is delivered exclusively by licensed clinicians practicing through Amwell’s affiliated provider group, Amwell Medical Group. Amwell itself does not provide medical care, treatment, or diagnosis", "averageUserRating":4.8872400000000002506794771761633455753326416015625, "contentAdvisoryRating":"17+", "userRatingCount":51925}, 
