"description":"Introducing American Well for Clinicians, the telehealth app that allows providers to conduct live video visits with patients using their iPhone or iPad.\n\nThis app allows you to:\n\n• \tMake yourself available at your own discretion, and see patients only when you have time\n• \tEasily conduct live, secure, HIPAA-compliant video visits\n• \tSee your own patient panel or expand your practice by seeing new patients\n• \tTake clinical notes, and if appropriate, diagnose and prescribe\n• \tReview clinical and pharmacological data \n• \tView real-time biometrics data for patients using Apple Health\n• \tGet paid automatically for your visits\n\n\nAmerican Well for Clinicians connects to the American Well telehealth ecosystem, comprising:  \n\n• \tOne of the leading telehealth services in the US\n• \tThe most popular consumer telehealth app worldwide in 2014 according to App Annie\n• \tThe first telehealth service awarded accreditation by The American Telemedicine Association \n• \tThe first telehealth platform to integrate with Apple’s Health App\n\nTo start using the app with existing or new patients, your identity and credentials must be verified by the Online Care Group in order to practice.  Click here to gain access:  https://www.americanwell.com/telehealth-medical-group/ \n\nCurrently, the Online Care Group provides medical services in all states except Alabama, Alaska, Arkansas, Louisiana and Texas and nutrition in all states except Kentucky.  Behavioral health services is available in all states.", "averageUserRating":1.6406300000000000327560201185406185686588287353515625, "contentAdvisoryRating":"17+", "userRatingCount":64}]
